---
import Main from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<Main title="服務詳情" subTitle="專業諮詢項目">
  <div class="services-page">
    <!-- Services Section -->
    <section class="services-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>專業諮詢項目</h2>
        <p>從專業易數占卜到系統化教學課程，我們提供深度的玄學洞察，協助您在人生的轉折點做出最明智的抉擇。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <!-- Service 1: 卜卦一個問題 + 六爻梅花經占合參 -->
        <div class="service-card featured">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3>卜卦一個問題</h3>
            <span class="subtitle">六爻梅花經占合參</span>
          </div>
          <p class="description">深入分析單一事件，結合六爻與梅花易數雙體系交叉驗證，提供詳盡指引。</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>200字以上深度解析</li>
            <li>六爻與梅花易數雙體系合參</li>
            <li>提供一個關於解析的追問</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <span class="price">$280</span>
            <a href="https://wa.me/" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              立即預約諮詢
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service 2: 梅花易數課程 -->
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3>梅花易數課程</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="description">易經基礎與核心理論，課程設計學完就能解卦。從入門到進階，系統化學習梅花易數。</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>初學者入坑指南</li>
            <li>基本起卦與斷卦技巧</li>
            <li>複雜案例解析</li>
            <li>進階象法知識分享</li>
            <li>個人案例一對一講解</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <span class="price">$3,980</span>
            <a href="https://wa.me/" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              立即預約諮詢
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service 3: 六爻課程 - 籌備中 -->
        <div class="service-card coming-soon">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3>六爻課程</h3>
            <span class="badge">籌備中</span>
          </div>
          <p class="description">系統化六爻占卜教學課程，敬請期待。</p>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <span class="price coming-soon-text">即將推出</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Booking Process Section -->
    <section class="process-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>預約流程</h2>
        <p>諮詢預約五步驟</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <h4>填寫預約表單</h4>
          <p>完整填寫預約表單，詳細描述您的諮詢需求，或者直接透過 WhatsApp 聯繫師兄。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <h4>確認預約資訊</h4>
          <p>我們將在 24 小時內聯繫您，確認服務詳情與諮詢時間安排。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <h4>完成付款</h4>
          <p>確認預約資訊無誤後，請依指示完成服務費用付款以保留名額。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
          <h4>開始占卜諮詢</h4>
          <p>師兄將為您進行專業的占卜或八字詳細解析。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">05</div>
          <h4>收到解卦結果</h4>
          <p>在約定的時間內，您將收到詳細的結果分析與具體建議。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="whatsapp-cta">
        <a href="https://wa.me/" class="btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          或者直接 WhatsApp 師兄
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>預約常見問題</h2>
        <p>常見疑問解答</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>預約後多久會收到回覆？</summary>
          <p>我們會在 24 小時內回覆您的預約查詢。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>可以取消或更改預約嗎？</summary>
          <p>請於預約時間前 24 小時通知我們，以便重新安排。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>付款方式有哪些？</summary>
          <p>我們接受銀行轉帳、轉數快（FPS）、PayMe 等付款方式，詳細資訊將於確認預約時提供。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>可以線上進行占卜嗎？</summary>
          <p>可以，占卜服務可透過 WhatsApp 語音或文字線上進行，不受地域限制。</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>隱私如何保護？</summary>
          <p>所有客戶資訊及占卜內容均嚴格保密，未經同意絕不對外公開。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Main>

<style>
  .services-page {
    @apply w-full space-y-12;
  }

  .section-header {
    @apply mb-8 text-center;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    @apply mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--text-color)];
  }

  .section-header p {
    @apply text-[var(--text-color-lighten)];
  }

  /* Services Grid */
  .services-grid {
    @apply grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3;
  }

  .service-card {
    @apply flex flex-col rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card-color)] p-6 transition-all hover:shadow-lg;
  }

  .service-card.featured {
    @apply ring-2 ring-[var(--primary-color)];
  }

  .card-header {
    @apply mb-4;
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    @apply text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text-color)];
  }

  .card-header .subtitle {
    @apply mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--primary-color)] font-medium;
  }

  .card-header .badge {
    @apply ml-2 inline-block rounded-full bg-[var(--primary-color-lighten)] px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--primary-color)];
  }

  .description {
    @apply mb-4 text-[var(--text-color-lighten)] leading-relaxed;
  }

  .features {
    @apply mb-6 flex-1 space-y-2;
  }

  .features li {
    @apply flex items-center text-sm text-[var(--text-color-lighten)];
  }

  .features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    @apply mr-2 text-[var(--primary-color)] font-bold;
  }

  .card-footer {
    @apply flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border-t pt-4;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .price {
    @apply text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--primary-color)];
  }

  .coming-soon-text {
    @apply text-lg text-[var(--text-color-lighten)] font-medium italic;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    @apply w-full rounded-full bg-[var(--primary-color)] px-6 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:brightness-110;
  }

  /* Process Section */
  .process-section {
    @apply rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card-color)] p-8;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    @apply grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-5;
  }

  .step {
    @apply text-center;
  }

  .step-number {
    @apply mx-auto mb-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--primary-color)] text-lg font-bold text-white;
  }

  .step h4 {
    @apply mb-1 font-semibold text-[var(--text-color)];
  }

  .step p {
    @apply text-sm text-[var(--text-color-lighten)] leading-relaxed;
  }

  .whatsapp-cta {
    @apply mt-8 text-center;
  }

  .btn-whatsapp {
    @apply inline-block rounded-full bg-[#25D366] px-8 py-3 font-medium text-white transition-all hover:brightness-110;
  }

  /* FAQ Section */
  .faq-section {
    @apply rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card-color)] p-8;
  }

  .faq-list {
    @apply mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-3;
  }

  .faq-item {
    @apply rounded-xl border transition-all;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    @apply cursor-pointer px-5 py-4 font-medium text-[var(--text-color)] select-none;
  }

  .faq-item summary:hover {
    @apply text-[var(--primary-color)];
  }

  .faq-item[open] {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color) 30%, transparent);
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color-lighten) 20%, transparent);
  }

  .faq-item[open] summary {
    @apply text-[var(--primary-color)] font-semibold;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    @apply px-5 pb-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-color-lighten)] leading-relaxed;
  }
</style>